 432:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   * @brief  Set or clear the selected data port bit.
 433:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *
 434:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   * @note   This function uses GPIOx_BSRR and GPIOx_BRR registers to allow atomic read/modify
 435:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *         accesses. In this way, there is no risk of an IRQ occurring between
 436:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *         the read and the modify access.
 437:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *
