 439:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   * @param  GPIO_Pin specifies the port bit to be written.
 440:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *         This parameter can be any combination of GPIO_Pin_x where x can be (0..15).
 441:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   * @param  PinState specifies the value to be written to the selected bit.
 442:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *         This parameter can be one of the GPIO_PinState enum values:
 443:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *            @arg GPIO_PIN_RESET: to clear the port pin
 444:../../../core/ST/STM32L4xx_HAL_Driver/Src/stm32l4xx_hal_gpio.c ****   *            @arg GPIO_PIN_SET: to set the port pin
